  "prefLabel": "Env-A 3103.01 Limited Authorization to Emit",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3103.01 Limited Authorization to Emit.\n\n(a) A DER created under this rule shall be a limited authorization to emit NOx and/or VOC.\n\n(b) A DER shall not constitute a property right.\n\n(c) Nothing in this rule shall be construed to limit the authority of the division or the United States EPA to terminate or limit such authorization.\n\nSource. #6441, EXEMPT, eff 1-21-97",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a3100.html"
}
